 and the Runner resource readings, NPU inventory included; the Project's Runner allowlist is edited here, and it includes the local Runner as a target while the machine cards list only remote ones.\n- **Dialog** — four pages under two groups, with Escape and a close button; the composer and the sidebar footer open it.\n\nEach page re-reads when it mounts rather than caching between visits, so a change made in one window is visible in another.\n\n## Stack\n\nPart **4 of 6**, built on #501. The PR is cumulative on `main`; the incremental change is the [compare against the previous branch](https://github.com/ink999107/sciencediscovery/compare/pr/03-workspace-panel...pr/04-settings).\n\n## Testing\n\n- `pnpm --filter @sciencediscovery/desktop typecheck` — pass\n- `pnpm --filter @sciencediscovery/desktop test` — 250 passed\n- The full `ci:l1` / `ci:ut` / `ci:st` layers were run on the tip of the stack\n\n## Merge order\n\nThis is PR 4 of 6 and the branches are stacked. Merge bottom-up with a merge or rebase (not squash) so the next PR collapses to its own commit, then move that branch onto the new `main` before merging it.\n","ci":{"checks":[{"conclusion":"success","name":"Select CI policy","url":"https://github.com/openJiuwen-ai/sciencediscovery/actions/runs/39893286758/job/120217768364"},{"conclusion":"success","name":"L1 (static checks)","url":"https://github.com/openJiuwen-ai/sciencediscovery/actions/runs/39893286758/job/120217846690"},{"conclusion":"skipped","name":"L4/L5 real E2E","url":"https://github.com/openJiuwen-ai/sciencediscovery/actions/runs/39893286758/job/120217848000"},{"conclusion":"success","name":"Freeze mocked E2E matrix","url":"https://github.com/openJiuwen-ai/sciencediscovery/actions/runs/39893286758/job/120217987567"},{"conclusion":"success","name":"UT","url":"https://github.com/openJiuwen-ai/sciencediscovery/actions/runs/39893286758/job/120217987539"},{"conclusion":"success","name":"ST","url":"https://github.com/openJiuwen-ai/sciencediscovery/act