e":"needs-human"}],"linked_issues":[501],"mergeable":"CONFLICTING","merged_at":null,"number":502,"requested_reviewers":["zhaozhaozz"],"review_decision":"REVIEW_REQUIRED","reviews":[{"author":"sciencediscovery-bot","state":"COMMENTED","submitted_at":"2026-10-22T14:57:56Z"},{"author":"HongyeZhou","state":"COMMENTED","submitted_at":"2026-10-22T15:03:44Z"},{"author":"zy95-12","state":"COMMENTED","submitted_at":"2026-10-23T00:11:12Z"},{"author":"zy95-12","state":"COMMENTED","submitted_at":"2026-10-23T01:36:43Z"},{"author":"HongyeZhou","state":"COMMENTED","submitted_at":"2026-10-23T02:01:13Z"},{"author":"zy95-12","state":"COMMENTED","submitted_at":"2026-10-23T02:11:46Z"},{"author":"HongyeZhou","state":"COMMENTED","submitted_at":"2026-10-23T03:03:00Z"},{"author":"zy95-12","state":"COMMENTED","submitted_at":"2026-10-23T03:10:17Z"},{"author":"HongyeZhou","state":"COMMENTED","submitted_at":"2026-10-23T04:00:37Z"},{"author":"zy95-12","state":"COMMENTED","submitted_at":"2026-10-23T04:08:35Z"}],"state":"open","title":"feat(desktop): add the settings dialog and execution-machine management","updated_at":"2026-10-23T04:08:35Z","url":"https://github.com/openJiuwen-ai/sciencediscovery/pull/502"},"503":{"assignees":[],"author":"ink999107","base":"main","body":"## Summary\n\nAdds the interface language setting:\n\n- **通用 page** — a language selector in the settings dialog, applied immediately rather than on save.\n- **Language store** — `use-language.ts` exposes the current language through `useSyncExternalStore`; the selected language is persisted and every `TEXT` read follows it.\n- **Document language** — `App` keeps `<html lang>` in step with the selection.\n- **Navigation** — 通用 joins the dialog under 系统, making five pages in three groups; 通用 opens by default.\n\n## Stack\n\nPart **5 of 6**, built on #502. The PR is cumulative on `main`; the incremental change is the [compare against the previous branch](https://github.com/ink999107/sciencediscovery/compare/pr/04-settings...pr/05-language).\n\n## Testing\n\n- `pnpm --filter @sciencediscovery/desktop typecheck` — pass\n- `pnpm --filter @sciencediscovery/desktop test` — 258 passed\n- The full `ci:l1` / `ci:ut` / `ci:st` layers were run on the tip of the stack\n\n## Merge order\n\nThis is PR 5 of 6 and the branches are stacked. Merge bottom-up with a merge or rebase (not squash) so the next PR collapses to its own commit, then move that branch onto the new `main` before merging it.\n","ci":{"checks":[{"conclusion":"success","name":"Select CI policy","url":"https://github.com/openJiuwen-ai/sciencediscovery/actions/runs/39893306926/job/120217834120"},{"conclusion":"success","name":"L1 (static checks)","url":"https://github.com/openJiuwen-ai/sciencediscovery/actions/runs/39893306926/job/120217893904"},{"conclusion":"skipped","name":"L4/L5 real E2E","url":"https://github.com/openJiuwen-ai/sciencediscovery/actions/runs/39893306926/job/120217895314"},{"conclusion":"success","name":"Freeze mocked E2E matrix","url":"https://github.com/openJiuwen-ai/sciencediscovery/actions/runs/39893306926/job/120218044918"},{"conclusion":"success","name":"UT","url":"https://github.com/openJiuwen-ai/sciencediscovery/actions/runs/39893306926/job/120218045001"},{"conclusion":"success","name":"ST","url":"https://github.com/openJiuwen-ai/sciencediscovery/actions/runs/39893306926/job/120218044943"},{"conclusion":"skipped","name":"Binary release (${{ matrix.arch }})","url":"https://github.com/openJiuwen-ai/sciencediscovery/actions/runs/39893306926/job/120218046879"},{"conclusion":"skipped","name":"Docker image","url":"https://github.com/openJiuwen-ai/sciencediscovery/actions/runs/39893306926/job/120218046304"},{"conclusion":"success","name":"L2 E2E (mocked, literature)","url":"https://github.com/openJiuwen-ai/sciencediscovery/actions/runs/39893306926/job/120218280221"},{"conclusion":"success","name":"L2 E2E (mocked, research)","url":"https://github.com/openJiuwen-ai/sciencediscovery/actions/runs/39893306926/job/120218280211"},{"conclusion":"success","name":"L2 E2E (mocked, standard-config)","url":"https://github.com/openJiuwen-ai/sciencediscovery/actions/runs/39893306926/job/120218280283"},{"conclusion":"success","name":"L2 E2E (mocked, standard-journeys)","url":"https://github.com/openJiuwen-ai/sciencediscovery/actions/runs/39893306926/job/120218280276"},{"conclusion":"success","name":"Coverage","url":"https://github.com/openJiuwen-ai/sciencediscovery/actions/runs/39893306926/job/120221541424"},{"conclusion":"skipped","name":"L3 real E2E","url":"https://github.com/openJiuwen-ai/sciencediscovery/actions/runs/39893306926/job/120222932982"},{"conclusion":"success","name":"merge-gate","url":"https://github.com/openJiuwen-ai/sciencediscovery/actions/runs/39893306926/job/120222931419"},{"conclusion":"failure","name":"CodeCheck (GitCode)","url":"https://gitcode.com/openJiuwen/sciencediscovery/merge_requests/337"},{"conclusion":"success","name":"license/cla","url":"https://cla-assistant.io/openJiuwen-ai/sciencediscovery?pullRequest=503"}],"state":"failure"},"closed_at":null,"comments":0,"created_at":"2026-10-22T14:46:28Z","draft":false,"head":"pr/05-language","head_repo":"ink999107/sciencediscovery","head_sha":"3bf325b4d5058632041cf8f59540c5ba6944c934","labels":[{"color":"0e8a16","name":"release:feature"},{"color":"d93f0b","name":"needs-human"}],"linked_issues":[502],"mergeable":"CONFLICTING","merged_at":null,"number":503,"requested_reviewers":["zhaozhaozz"],"review_decision":"REVIEW_REQUIRED","reviews":[{"author":"sciencediscovery-bot","state":"COMMENTED","submitted_at":"2026-10-22T14:58:00Z"},{"author":"HongyeZhou","state":"DISMISSED","submitted_at":"2026-10-22T15:03:48Z"},{"author":"zy95-12","state":"COMMENTED","submitted_at":"2026-10-23T00:11:12Z"},{"author":"zy95-12","state":"COMMENTED","submitted_at":"2026-10-23T01:36:45Z"},{"author":"HongyeZhou","state":"COMMENTED","submitted_at":"2026-10-23T02:02:49Z"},{"author":"zy95-12","state":"COMMENTED","submitted_at":"2026-10-23T02:11:47Z"},{"author":"HongyeZhou","state":"COMMENTED","submitted_at":"2026-10-23T03:03:02Z"},{"author":"zy95-12","state":"COMMENTED","submitted_at":"2026-10-23T03:10:17Z"},{"author":"HongyeZhou","state":"COMMENTED","submitted_at":"2026-10-23T04:00:40Z"},{"author":"zy95-12","state":"COMMENTED","submitted_at":"2026-10-23T04:08:35Z"}],"state":"open","title":"feat(desktop): add the interface language setting","updated_at":"2026-10-23T04:08:36Z","url":"https://github.com/openJiuwen-ai/sciencediscovery/pull/503"},"504":{"assignees":[],"author":"ink999107","base":"main","body":"## Summary\n\nResumes the most recent session when the app starts.\n\n- `resumeSession` in `session-order.ts` returns the most recently updated session, or `undefined` when a session is already open, so the decision is testable on its own.\n- The workspace bootstrap runs it once per load, after the session lists have been read; a resumed session opens the same way a clicked one does.\n- Sessions are still ordered by recency, and the list that was already current in the sidebar is the one the app resumes.\n\n## Stack\n\nPart **6 of 6**, built on #503. The PR is cumulative on `main`; the incremental change is the [compare against the previous branch](https://github.com/ink999107/sciencediscovery/compare/pr/05-language...pr/06-resume).\n\n## Testing\n\n- `pnpm --filter @sciencediscovery/desktop typecheck` — pass\n- `pnpm --filter @sciencediscovery/desktop test` — 260 passed\n- `pnpm ci:l1` — planned 4, executed 4, passed 4\n- `pnpm ci:ut` — planned 4707, executed 4678, passed 4675; the three failures are pre-existing on `main` in this environment (a bwrap version without `--disable-userns`, an offline PyPI cache, and `jiuwenswarm-agent.test.ts`)\n- `pnpm ci:st` — planned 24, executed 24, passed 22; the two failures need network (a pinned Python runtime download and the JiuwenSwarm SDK's `playwright` wheel)\n- `pnpm ci:e2e` — preparation could not download Chromium in this environment, so no E2E case was executed\n\n## Merge order\n\nThis is PR 6 of 6 and the branches are stacked. Merge bottom-up with a merge or rebase (not squash) so the next PR collapses to its own commit, then move that branch onto the new `main` before merging it.\n","ci":{"checks":[{"conclusion":"success","name":"Select CI policy","url":"https://github.com/openJiuwen-ai/sciencediscovery/actions/runs/39893319333/job/120217872387"},{"conclusion":"success","name":"L1 (static checks)","url":"https://github.com/openJiuwen-ai/sciencediscovery/actions/runs/39893319333/job/120217929550"},{"conclusion":"skipped","name":"L4/L5 real E2E","url":"https://github.com/openJiuwen-ai/sciencediscovery/actions/runs/39893319333/job/120217930949"},{"conclusion":"success","name":"Freeze mocked E2E matrix","url":"https://github.com/openJiuwen-ai/sciencediscovery/actions/runs/39893319333/job/120218136204"},{"conclusion":"success","name":"UT","url":"https://github.com/openJiuwen-ai/sciencediscovery/actions/runs/39893319333/job/120218137492"},{"conclusion":"success","name":"ST","url":"https://github.com/openJiuwen-ai/sciencediscovery/actions/runs/39893319333/job/120218136276"},{"conclusion":"skipped","name":"Binary release (${{ matrix.arch }})","url":"https://github.com/openJiuwen-ai/sciencediscovery/actions/runs/39893319333/job/120218137767"},{"conclusion":"skipped","name":"Docker image","url":"https://github.com/openJiuwen-ai/sciencediscovery/actions/runs/39893319333/job/120218137180"},{"conclusion":"success","name":"L2 E2E (mocked, literature)","url":"https://github.com/openJiuwen-ai/sciencediscovery/actions/runs/39893319333/job/120218949888"},{"conclusion":"success","name":"L2 E2E (mocked, research)","url":"https://github.com/openJiuwen-ai/sciencediscovery/actions/runs/39893319333/job/120218949889"},{"conclusion":"success","name":"L2 E2E (mocked, standard-config)","url":"https://github.com/openJiuwen-ai/sciencediscovery/actions/runs/39893319333/job/120218949986"},{"conclusion":"success","name":"L2 E2E (mocked, standard-journeys)